<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to launch 500 mln peso, 10-yr Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Argentina to launch 500 mln peso, 10-yr Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina will launch Wednesday a 10-year, 500 million peso Eurobond, a government source said.</p>
<p>The official told Reuters that Economy Minister Roque Fernandez made the announcement earlier in the day at the World Economic Forum annual meeting in Davos, Switzerland.</p>
<p>Rumors of the issue by bond market traders first emerged early Wednesday.</p>
</text>
